    ("sanctum tokens", "Sanctum issues scoped API tokens (`createToken(..., ['baca'])`) plus SPA cookie auth; abilities gate per-endpoint in middleware."),
    ("schedule work list", "`schedule:list` shows due tasks, `schedule:work` runs the loop locally; one system cron hitting `schedule:run` drives prod."),
